flowchart TB
  accTitle: PulseLink — from field care to hospital receipt
  accDescr: EMS creates a draft, records care and advances transport. The destination hospital sees incoming and arrived reports. EMS completes handoff, then hospital staff acknowledges report receipt separately from clinical responsibility.
  A["Start incident · Draft"] --> B["En route → On scene<br/>Record observations, treatments and narrative"]
  B --> C["Transporting<br/>Destination hospital required"]
  C --> D["Arrived<br/>EMS handoff pending"]
  D --> E["Handed off<br/>Clinical editing closes"]
  C -.-> F["Hospital queue · Incoming"]
  D -.-> G["Hospital queue · Arrived"]
  E --> H["Awaiting acknowledgment<br/>Review the handoff report"]
  H --> I["Acknowledged<br/>Report receipt confirmed"]
